  m_text: 'WASD for movements

    Hold Shift for sprint

    E to interact

    F
    to attack(with sword only)

    I to open inventory and crafting

    Mouse double
    click to hotslot/go to inventory

    T to change camera angle

    R to consume

    1-0
    for hot key and equip



'
