--- !u!114 &2114299930
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2114299928}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Unknown Journal\n\nDay 1\nThe shipwreck\u2026 I still can\u2019t believe
    it. It seems I\u2019m the only one who survived.\nAll night I heard the screams
    echoing in my head, the desperate cries for rescue.\nSomehow, by sheer luck,
    I washed up on this island.\n\nDay 1\nThis place isn\u2019t as empty as I first
    thought.\nThere are old artifacts scattered around\u2014signs that a small civilization
    may have lived here long ago.\nBut where are they now?\n\nI found strange stone
    pyramids across the island. At night, they glow faintly\u2026 and they can heal
    my wounds. I have no explanation for it.\n\nDay 1\nThe sun is brutal at noon.
    It dries my throat and burns my skin.\nI discovered a large pond near the center
    of the island.\nIt\u2019s safe to drink from\u2014during the day, at least.\nWhen
    night falls, I hear howling from the darkness. I won\u2019t risk getting close.\n\nDay
    2\nCreatures roam the island after sunset.\nOne attacked me last night\u2026
    I barely killed it.\nThey chase me in the dark but flee at sunrise.\nFood is
    scarce. The only source of meat is from those creatures\u2014if I\u2019m lucky
    enough to survive the encounter.\n\nDay 2\nI think I finally understand where
    I am.\nThis island lies along an old trade route.\nCargo ships should pass by
    every five days.\nIf my luck holds, help should arrive soon.\nAll I have to do\u2026
    is survive long enough to be rescued.\nBut I hear more and more howlings...."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
